{"about_the_game":"Explore, fight, and fly as a small rabbit with swift moves in this action-adventure game inspired by Zelda and Crouching Tiger, Hidden Dragon. Discover ancient secrets, vanquish monsters from Chinese mythology, and choose to use dragon power or stay uncorrupted.<br><br>Key features<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Fly through the air, run up walls, and glide across water using wuxia qinggong like in Crouching Tiger Hidden Dragon.<br></li><li> Fight mythological monsters from the ancient text, Classic of the Mountains and Seas from two thousand years ago<br></li><li> Explore the beautiful ancient land of Penglai Immortal Island, filled with gods, secrets, and treasure<br></li><li> Choose between the Goddess or the Dragon Emperor. Will you become a hero who saves the world or a demon that destroys it?</li></ul><br><strong>Powerful movement abilities</strong><br>Fly through the air, run up walls, and glide across water using qinggong like in Crouching Tiger Hidden Dragon.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986350/extras/1cc09783fffab0f329e5146ad9a233fa.poster.avif?t=1767732194\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986350/extras/1cc09783fffab0f329e5146ad9a233fa.webm?t=1767732194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986350/extras/1cc09783fffab0f329e5146ad9a233fa.mp4?t=1767732194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Epic and satisfying fights</strong><br>Vanquish mythological monsters from the ancient text, Classic of the Mountains and Seas from two thousand years ago.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986350/extras/ea851fad60aed3c30dfc58987fe8e592.poster.avif?t=1767732194\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986350/extras/ea851fad60aed3c30dfc58987fe8e592.webm?t=1767732194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986350/extras/ea851fad60aed3c30dfc58987fe8e592.mp4?t=1767732194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Choose your challenge level</strong><br>Choose between the Goddess or the Dragon Emperor, who gives you power at a terrible cost. Will you become the hero who saves the world or a demon that destroys it?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986350/extras/ca1a8a45d82865585eefa229f2669109.poster.avif?t=1767732194\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986350/extras/ca1a8a45d82865585eefa229f2669109.webm?t=1767732194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986350/extras/ca1a8a45d82865585eefa229f2669109.mp4?t=1767732194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Explore the Garden of the Gods</strong><br>Explore the beautiful ancient land of Penglai Immortal Island, filled with gods, secrets, and treasure.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986350/extras/a99a3efea44dcc275c019795c633cb8b.poster.avif?t=1767732194\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986350/extras/a99a3efea44dcc275c019795c633cb8b.webm?t=1767732194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986350/extras/a99a3efea44dcc275c019795c633cb8b.mp4?t=176773